menu "DDSM400 motor UART"
config DDSM_TX
    int "ESP32 motor UART TX GPIO"
    range 0 33
    default 19
    help
        Waveshare DDSM Driver HAT (B) schematic routes GPIO19 to Bus_TXD.
        Change only if using a different board revision or custom wiring.
config DDSM_RX
    int "ESP32 motor UART RX GPIO"
    range 0 39
    default 18
    help
        Waveshare DDSM Driver HAT (B) schematic routes Bus_RXD to GPIO18.
        Change only if using a different board revision or custom wiring.
endmenu
